{"parse":{"title":"Tin","pageid":124,"revid":51715,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Tin</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/80/Tin.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132029\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Tin\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/80/Tin.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132029\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/80/Tin.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132029 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/80/Tin.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132029 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Tin\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-key=\"Tin.png\" data-image-name=\"Tin.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i>A bar of pure tin ready to be worked.</i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metal</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Internal ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tin</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Smelter\" title=\"Smelter\">Smelter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Building, Crafting</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Weight</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">Stack</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">8.0</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">30</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"teleport\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"Can go through wood portal?\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Teleportable</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">No</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Crafting Materials</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tin_ore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tin ore\">Tin ore</a> x1</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Tin</b> is a crafting material smelted from <a href=\"/wiki/Tin_ore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tin ore\">Tin ore</a> in a <a href=\"/wiki/Smelter\" title=\"Smelter\">Smelter</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Just like <a href=\"/wiki/Copper_ore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Copper ore\">Copper ore</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tin_ore\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tin ore\">Tin ore</a> can only be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Forest\" title=\"Black Forest\">Black Forest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Biomes\" title=\"Biomes\">biome</a>. It takes the form of small shiny rock-like deposits on the ground near water (ocean &amp; river shorelines, or small inland lakes).\n</p><p>An <a href=\"/wiki/Antler_pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Antler pickaxe\">Antler pickaxe</a> or better is required to mine the rocks, which yield 2-4 Tin ore each.\n</p><p>One Tin can be processed with two <a href=\"/wiki/Copper\" title=\"Copper\">Copper</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">Forge</a> to create one <a href=\"/wiki/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\">Bronze</a>. There is also an alternate recipe to craft 5 Bronze at a time given sufficient materials (10 copper, 5 tin).\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Building\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Building</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Crafting\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Crafting</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTin%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Building\">Building</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTin%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cauldron\" title=\"Cauldron\"><img alt=\"Cauldron\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/3/37/Cauldron.png/revision/latest/scal